<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666"><br></font></span></h1><h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666">Welcome to National Funding!</font></span></h1>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">I wanted to thank you for taking time away from your
business to speak with me today. As I mentioned earlier, my name is {!Lead.OwnerFirstName}
from National Funding, and I will be your personal Account Executive to assist
you in completing the application process so we can get you a quick and
accurate quote.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">To complete your application I will need you to
compile the following documents, if you have not already done so:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><li><p>Complete and sign the attached Merchant Prequalification Form</p></li><li><p>Collect the last 6 months of your business' bank statements</p></li><li><p>Collect the last 4 months of merchant account statements, if you business accepts credit cards</p></li><li><p>Collect the first page of your most recent tax return</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">Once you have compiled all the necessary documentation
listed above, you can fax it to me at {!User.Fax}, or scan and email it to me
at {!Lead.OwnerEmail}. Once I have all of your documentation, I will be able to
process your complete application and get back to you with an accurate quote.
In the meantime, should you have any questions or concerns, please feel free to
call or email me directly.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;">I look forward to hearing from you!&nbsp;<br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">National Funding</strong><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt;"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif">If you no longer wish to receive emails from&nbsp;National Funding, send an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:emailreply@nationalfunding.com">emailreply@nationalfunding.com</a>&nbsp;with Unsubscribe in the subject line. You may also unsubscribe by sending written notice to:&nbsp;National Funding&nbsp;Unsubscribe<br>&nbsp;9530 Towne Centre Dr., Suite 120, San Diego, CA 92121. Thank you.&nbsp;<br>National Funding&nbsp;</font></font></font></span></font></font></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">respects your privacy. Our commitment to your privacy is described in our Privacy Policy which is available on our Web site for your reference.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">© 2018 National Funding. &nbsp;All Rights Reserved.&nbsp;</span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>